<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE learningOverview PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Learning Overview//EN" "learningOverview.dtd">
<learningOverview id="learning-overview" xml:lang="zh-CN"
    class="- topic/topic learningOverview/learningOverview ">
    <title>学习路径：从采集到发布</title>
    <shortdesc>一条面向新成员的学习路径，覆盖内容采集、DITA 解析、渲染与发布。</shortdesc>
    <learningOverviewbody class="- topic/body learningOverview/learningOverviewbody ">
        <lcIntro class="- topic/section learningOverview/lcIntro ">
            <title>课程简介</title>
            <p>这条路径假设你已经安装 <ph keyref="product-name"/>，并拥有一个可用的键映射。
                每个阶段都包含阅读材料和一个可选的练习。</p>
        </lcIntro>

        <lcObjectives class="- topic/section learningOverview/lcObjectives ">
            <title>学习目标</title>
            <lcObjectivesStem>完成本路径后，你应能够：</lcObjectivesStem>
            <lcObjectivesGroup>
                <lcObjective>解释采集、解析、渲染与发布的分工。</lcObjective>
                <lcObjective>使用共享内容与键引用减少重复。</lcObjective>
                <lcObjective>定位常见的引用与条件处理问题。</lcObjective>
            </lcObjectivesGroup>
        </lcObjectives>

        <section id="modules">
            <title>模块</title>
            <simpletable>
                <sthead>
                    <stentry>模块</stentry>
                    <stentry>阅读</stentry>
                    <stentry>练习</stentry>
                </sthead>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>基础</stentry>
                    <stentry><xref href="overview.dita">产品概览</xref></stentry>
                    <stentry>画出一张数据流图</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>安装</stentry>
                    <stentry><xref href="install-cli.dita">安装命令行工具</xref></stentry>
                    <stentry>验证 <ph>flowctl</ph> 版本</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>发布</stentry>
                    <stentry><xref href="getting-started.dita">快速开始</xref></stentry>
                    <stentry>生成一个站点</stentry>
                </strow>
                <strow>
                    <stentry>排错</stentry>
                    <stentry><xref href="troubleshooting.dita">故障排查</xref></stentry>
                    <stentry>修复一个未解析的键</stentry>
                </strow>
            </simpletable>
        </section>

        <section id="assessment">
            <title>自测</title>
            <p>完成路径后，尝试回答：</p>
            <ol>
                <li>为什么共享内容库不应直接出现在站点导航中？</li>
                <li><ph>conkeyref</ph> 与 <ph>keyref</ph> 的区别是什么？</li>
                <li>条件属性在预览与发布阶段分别如何处理？</li>
            </ol>
            <note type="tip">参考答案散落在<xref href="how-it-works.dita">工作原理</xref>与
                <xref href="release-notes.dita#release-notes/known-issues">已知问题</xref>中。</note>
        </section>
    </learningOverviewbody>
</learningOverview>
